# Backend build context (repository root). Keeps `docker build -f src/**/Dockerfile .` from sending
# build artifacts, the frontend's own node_modules, git history, or docs into the daemon.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/

.git/
.github/

docs/
tests/
third_party/
frontend/

*.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
